{"ticker":"CHRW","updated":"2026-10-30T22:39:57Z","profile":{"longName":"C.H. Robinson Worldwide, Inc.","shortName":"C.H. Robinson Worldwide, Inc.","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Integrated Freight & Logistics","country":"United States","website":"https://www.chrobinson.com","fullTimeEmployees":11118,"marketCap":14388011008,"trailingPE":22.371634,"forwardPE":16.665195,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":0.78978086,"pegRatio":1.52,"targetMeanPrice":182.78261,"targetHighPrice":235.0,"targetLowPrice":131.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":23,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.295,"earningsGrowth":0.246,"grossMargins":0.08342,"operatingMargins":0.05426,"profitMargins":0.03671,"totalRevenue":18217725952,"beta":0.949,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":210.33,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":122.21,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.98},"summary":"C.H. Robinson Worldwide, Inc., together with its subsidiaries, provides freight transportation and related logistics and supply chain services in the United States and internationally. It operates in two segments, North American Surface Transportation and Global Forwarding. The company offers transportation and logistics services, such as truckload; less than truckload transportation brokerage services, which include the shipment of single or multiple pallets of freight; intermodal transportation that comprises the shipment service of freight in containers or trailers by a combination of truck and rail; and non-vessel operating common carrier and freight forwarding services, as well as organizes indirect air carrier and freight forwarder providing door-to-door services. It also provides customs brokerage services; and other logistics services, such as fee-based managed, warehousing, supply chain consulting and optimization services, and other services. In addition, the company is involved in the buying, selling, and/or marketing of fresh fruits, vegetables, and other value-added perishable items under the Robinson Fresh trade name. Further, the company offers transportation management and other surface transportation services. It provides fresh produce to grocery retailers, restaurants, produce wholesalers. C.H. Robinson Worldwide, Inc. was founded in 1905 and is headquartered ","summary_zh":"C.H. Robinson Worldwide, Inc. 及其子公司在美國和國際範圍內提供貨運及相關物流和供應鏈服務。它的業務分為兩個部分：北美地面運輸和全球貨運。本公司提供整車運輸及物流服務；零擔運輸經紀服務，包括單一或多個托盤貨物的運輸；多式聯運，包括透過卡車和鐵路相結合的貨櫃或拖車貨運服務；和無船承運人經營普通承運和貨運代理服務，以及組織間接空運和貨運代理提供門到門服務。它還提供報關服務；以及其他物流服務，如收費託管、倉儲、供應鏈諮詢和優化服務等服務。此外，該公司還以 Robinson Fresh 商標參與新鮮水果、蔬菜和其他增值易腐物品的購買、銷售和/或行銷。此外，該公司還提供運輸管理和其他地面運輸服務。它為雜貨零售商、餐廳、農產品批發商提供新鮮農產品。 C.H. Robinson Worldwide, Inc. 成立於 1905 年，總部位於","sector_zh":"工業","industry_zh":"綜合貨運及物流","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":128.03,"h":129.05,"l":127.51,"c":128.89,"v":1366700},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":128.36,"h":129.39,"l":127.35,"c":128.79,"v":1001500},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":128.47,"h":129.23,"l":127.17,"c":127.84,"v":1285900},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":126.97,"h":127.8,"l":124.15,"c":126.13,"v":1448000},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":126.39,"h":126.78,"l":125.23,"c":125.9,"v":1217700},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":125.52,"h":126.59,"l":125.12,"c":126.05,"v":944100},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":125.34,"h":127.83,"l":125.3,"c":127.64,"v":1180300},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":127.24,"h":131.18,"l":126.9,"c":131.02,"v":1607100},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":130.6,"h":132.92,"l":130.45,"c":132.41,"v":1412300},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":132.71,"h":134.91,"l":132.02,"c":133.27,"v":1599000},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":133.24,"h":134.04,"l":132.04,"c":133.77,"v":2061800},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":133.79,"h":137.03,"l":133.25,"c":135.09,"v":2151900},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":136.35,"h":137.91,"l":136.06,"c":137.09,"v":1809300},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":137.25,"h":138.0,"l":134.91,"c":136.07,"v":4619000},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":136.02,"h":136.22,"l":132.97,"c":133.98,"v":2037000},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":133.98,"h":136.31,"l":133.57,"c":134.24,"v":1687500},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":134.79,"h":135.53,"l":131.6,"c":133.3,"v":2231200},{"t":"2025-09-25","o"